1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,649
Cecilia answers account and payment questions for Spanish- and

2
00:00:03,742 --> 00:00:07,852
Portuguese-speaking bank customers, straight from verified bank data.

3
00:00:08,177 --> 00:00:11,974
Customers check a balance or chase a pending transfer in their own language,

4
00:00:12,148 --> 00:00:14,214
and see where each figure came from.

5
00:00:14,539 --> 00:00:16,884
Anything sensitive goes to a person.

6
00:00:17,045 --> 00:00:21,027
These everyday questions make up thirty-five percent of contacts in the

7
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:22,664
bank's synthetic history.

8
00:00:22,989 --> 00:00:27,122
Customers queue for about two minutes, and satisfaction sits at two point

9
00:00:27,192 --> 00:00:28,655
nine out of five.

10
00:00:28,815 --> 00:00:31,392
But nobody wants a model inventing a balance.

11
00:00:31,636 --> 00:00:35,351
In Cecilia, the model only chooses which lookup to run.

12
00:00:35,595 --> 00:00:39,554
Code checks ownership, reads the bank record and writes the reply.

13
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:43,211
Customer records never enter the model request.

14
00:00:43,371 --> 00:00:45,171
Here's how that looks in Spanish.

15
00:00:45,414 --> 00:00:49,431
Ask for a balance, and Cecilia returns the recorded balances with their

16
00:00:49,489 --> 00:00:50,581
source and date.

17
00:00:50,906 --> 00:00:55,027
Open Why to see the lookup the model chose and the checks the code ran.

18
00:00:55,188 --> 00:00:56,953
Portuguese gets the same treatment.

19
00:00:57,278 --> 00:01:01,399
Ask about late card payments, and the reply comes back in Portuguese, with

20
00:01:01,434 --> 00:01:03,454
the same source and date.

21
00:01:03,614 --> 00:01:04,729
Those were lookups.

22
00:01:04,938 --> 00:01:09,802
For a pending transfer, Cecilia finds the movement and asks before acting.

23
00:01:10,127 --> 00:01:14,272
Only after a clear yes does code open a trace and read it back from the

24
00:01:14,307 --> 00:01:14,899
service.

25
00:01:15,178 --> 00:01:18,545
The receipt says the trace is open, not that the money arrived.

26
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:21,540
The bank console shows the same request.

27
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:23,767
Some cases belong with a person.

28
00:01:24,045 --> 00:01:27,679
An unrecognized charge goes to the bank before any model call.

29
00:01:27,958 --> 00:01:32,346
In that same console, the operator gets verified evidence, open questions

30
00:01:32,404 --> 00:01:35,899
and a suggested next step, then takes the case.

31
00:01:36,108 --> 00:01:39,441
Cecilia doesn't block cards or decide disputes.

32
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:42,096
Nor will it hand over someone else's data.

33
00:01:42,421 --> 00:01:45,974
Ask for another customer's balance, and it opens a security case.

34
00:01:46,253 --> 00:01:50,699
When we deliberately simulate a model outage, verified balances keep

35
00:01:50,769 --> 00:01:54,600
working, and anything that needs the model goes to a person.

36
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:57,245
A demo only shows the cases we picked.

37
00:01:57,570 --> 00:02:01,517
So we wrote five hundred forty-eight tests in Spanish and Portuguese.

38
00:02:01,796 --> 00:02:06,150
On the two hundred thirty-eight in scope, Cecilia on Sonnet five resolved

39
00:02:06,301 --> 00:02:10,469
ninety-seven point one percent safely, versus seventy point two for

40
00:02:10,527 --> 00:02:11,247
keywords.

41
00:02:11,572 --> 00:02:16,483
Three runs, zero unsafe outcomes, though the first run missed one required

42
00:02:16,552 --> 00:02:17,795
escalation.

43
00:02:17,954 --> 00:02:21,240
That's twenty-six point nine percentage points above keywords.

44
00:02:21,565 --> 00:02:25,500
All one hundred seventy-one handoffs included the required context for an

45
00:02:25,559 --> 00:02:26,290
operator.

46
00:02:26,569 --> 00:02:31,410
Speed mattered too: half of responses took under one point five seconds, and

47
00:02:31,491 --> 00:02:34,765
ninety-five percent took under three in that test run.

48
00:02:34,925 --> 00:02:38,257
The deployed demo passed the seven scenarios we selected.

49
00:02:38,501 --> 00:02:41,194
Try the customer app and the bank console today.
